#: includes/admin/import.php:61
msgid "Recognised columns: <code>first_name</code>, <code>last_name</code>, <code>email</code>, <code>phone</code>. Only <code>first_name</code> is required; <code>last_name</code>, <code>email</code> and <code>phone</code> are optional."
